jectsOfType: Gets a list of all loaded objects of Type type.\nMethod Instantiate: Clones the object original and returns the clone.\nMethod InstantiateAsync: Captures a snapshot of the original object (that must be related to some\nGameObject) and returns the AsyncInstantiateOperation.\nOperator bool: Does the object exist?\nOperator operator !=: Compares if two objects refer to a different object.\nOperator operator ==: Compares two object references to see if they refer to the same object.\nMessage OnPostRender: Event function that Unity calls after a Camera renders the scene.\nMessage OnPreCull: Event function that Unity calls before a Camera culls the scene.\nMessage OnPreRender: Event function that Unity calls before a Camera renders the scene.\nMessage OnRenderImage: Event function that Unity calls after a Camera has finished rendering, that allows\nyou to modify the Camera's final image.\nMessage OnRenderObject: OnRenderObject is called after camera has rendered the Scene.\nMessage OnWillRenderObject: OnWillRenderObject is called for each camera if the object is visible."}
